# What the app's build makes (doc-page/doc/zene-deploy-mobile-capacitor.md#what-git-keeps): the web
# build, the apk copied out of the Android build. The Android project keeps its own lists
# (android/.gitignore, android/app/.gitignore): its build, gradle's state, local.properties, and
# the copy of dist/ and of capacitor.config.json that `cap sync` puts into it.
node_modules/
dist/
build-apk/
*.apk
*.aab
